sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant L as Raft leader
    participant F2 as Follower 2
    participant F3 as Follower 3
    C->>L: ALTER TABLE
    L->>L: Append entry to log
    par Replicate
      L->>F2: Log entry
      L->>F3: Log entry
    end
    F2-->>L: Stored
    Note over L,F2: Leader + Follower 2 = majority (2 of 3)
    L->>L: Commit entry and apply schema change
    L-->>C: Success
    F3-->>L: Stored later
    Note over L,F3: Followers apply committed entries in log order
